import Mathlib.Tactic.FinCases

/-!
# Affine stabilizer level 2: generators and orbit representatives

Part of the finite permutation certificate for the fixed J₃ affine candidate.
Source: GLS, Number 3, Table 5.3h, printed p.269; the retained ATLAS
J3G1-p6156B0 maps and candidate words are under `TwoLocal/source`.
Generated by `Affine/source/generate.py`; every identity is kernel checked.
